Backport reproducible image support from squashfs-tools 4.4.

Upstream: https://github.com/plougher/squashfs-tools
Commits: ff37bf9, 9295555, 24da0c6, e0d74d0, 6cd66c6, 5883059
         828888d, d1a546a, a033a3e, 7fa76a2, 7db33c9

Keep the AVM mkfs_time == bytes_used convention from patch 550.
Append/restore support is already removed by patch 240.
SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH clamps inode timestamps; -all-time forces them.
Parallel fragment ordering is reproducible by default and can be
disabled with -not-reproducible.

